# head/adult/ears_half: half-breed ears: a 1 px tip up, drawn over the hair
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to FACES in wave 2). Every head type keeps A3's eye rows and columns, the nose pixel
# and the mouth row (STYLE_P2 4), so expressions, marks and paint fit them all. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult youth
role ears half
layer ears
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin 0 -8
|q..............q
|qt............sq
|qs............rq

view U key rest origin 0 -8
|q..............q
|qt............sq
|qs............rq

view R key rest origin -5 -7
|.q.
|qtq
|qts
|.sr
|.qr

view L key rest origin -8 -7
|.q.
|qtq
|tsq
|sr.
|rq.
